,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e30a-db0e-11ef-95b3-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":566,"link_death_year":597,"link_td_description":"世伏，吐谷浑第十九任统治者，他为夸吕的儿子，慕容姓。","link_td_id":"Q10009935","link_td_number_id":913686,"people_name":"世伏","people_name_jianti_auto":"世伏","people_xingming":"世伏","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e30b-db0e-11ef-bcab-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"無素","people_name_jianti_auto":"无素","people_xingming":"無素","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e30c-db0e-11ef-80a5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"無素","people_name_jianti_auto":"无素","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e30d-db0e-11ef-afcb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"吐谷渾","place_name_jianti_auto":"吐谷浑","place_note":"青海省","resolved_place_entity_id":250,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e308-db0e-11ef-b846-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陳","place_name_jianti_auto":"陈","resolved_place_entity_id":272,"start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e309-db0e-11ef-af31-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十四、哈密卫（卷六十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"十七年，国乱，国人杀世伏，立弟伏允，朝贡于隋。大业四年，...","context_before":"...遁，部落多降于隋。隋以其高宁王移兹裒为河南王，使统降众。","source_end_index":724,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f53474e9-3544-51b8-abe1-149986868b1a","source_start_index":710,"source_text":"十一年，夸吕卒，其子世伏立。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十四、哈密卫（卷六十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["外交"],"content":"2二月，戊午，吐谷渾遣使入貢。吐谷渾可汗夸呂聞陳亡，大懼，遁逃保險，不敢爲寇。夸呂卒，子世伏立，使其兄子無素奉表稱藩，幷獻方物，請以女備後庭。上謂無素曰：「若依來請，他國聞之，必當相傚，何以拒之！朕情存安養，各令遂性，豈可聚斂子女以實後宮乎！」竟不許。","content_fanyi":"二月戊午日，吐谷浑派遣使者入朝进贡。吐谷浑可汗夸吕听说陈朝灭亡，非常恐惧，便逃往险要之处据守，不敢再侵犯劫掠。夸吕去世后，其子世伏继立为可汗，派他哥哥的儿子无素上表称藩，并进献地方特产，请求送女儿入后宫侍奉。隋文帝对无素说：“如果答应了这一请求，其他国家听说后，必定会纷纷仿效，那时用什么理由拒绝他们呢！朕的心意在于安抚养育百姓，让各自顺遂天性，怎么能搜罗女子来充实后宫呢！”最终没有同意。","content_jianti_auto":"2二月，戊午，吐谷浑遣使入贡。吐谷浑可汗夸吕闻陈亡，大惧，遁逃保险，不敢为寇。夸吕卒，子世伏立，使其兄子无素奉表称藩，幷献方物，请以女备后庭。上谓无素曰：「若依来请，他国闻之，必当相傚，何以拒之！朕情存安养，各令遂性，岂可聚敛子女以实后宫乎！」竟不许。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17224,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e304-db0e-11ef-9429-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"平鄕縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"平鄕县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e310-db0e-11ef-a2c1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"襄國郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"襄国郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e311-db0e-11ef-bcc1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"平鄕縣屬襄國郡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"平鄕县属襄国郡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e30f-db0e-11ef-8759-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"臨潁縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"临颍县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e313-db0e-11ef-ade9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"潁川郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"颍川郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e314-db0e-11ef-8e1f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"潁川郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"颍川郡","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e315-db0e-11ef-9dc1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"許州","place_name_jianti_auto":"许州","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e316-db0e-11ef-b85a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"臨潁縣屬潁川郡，潁川郡時爲許州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"临颍县属颍川郡，颍川郡时为许州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e312-db0e-11ef-b54f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"琅邪郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"琅邪郡","