eath_year":607,"link_td_description":"高颎，字昭玄，一名敏，渤海郡蓨县（今河北景县）人，其父高宾为独孤信赐姓独孤氏，因此又称独孤颎，为隋朝宰相执政近20年，其子是杨勇的女婿，后因反对废太子杨勇并得罪独孤皇后，遭隋文帝猜忌，被免官为民，不久后又免去齐国公爵位。隋炀帝时，被起用为太常卿。大业三年，见炀帝奢靡，甚为忧虑，有所议论，为人告发，与贺若弼同时被杀害。诸子遭到流放。","link_td_id":"Q10001643","link_td_number_id":329611,"people_name":"高熲","people_name_jianti_auto":"高颎","people_xingming":"高熲","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e322-db0e-11ef-86c6-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":528,"link_death_year":595,"link_td_description":"刘旷，字宽亮，信都郡武强县人，隋朝官员。","link_td_id":"Q10007360","link_td_number_id":6790591,"people_name":"曠","people_name_jianti_auto":"旷","people_xingming":"刘旷","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e323-db0e-11ef-8071-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"平鄕","place_name_jianti_auto":"平鄕","resolved_place_entity_id":4595,"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e320-db0e-11ef-afda-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"臨潁","place_name_jianti_auto":"临颍","place_note":"河南省临颍县","resolved_place_entity_id":2966,"start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e321-db0e-11ef-a253-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"莒州","place_name_jianti_auto":"莒州","resolved_place_entity_id":1777,"start_index":85,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e324-db0e-11ef-a36c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"3平鄕令劉曠有異政，以義理曉諭，訟者皆引咎而去，獄中草滿，庭可張羅；遷臨潁令。高熲薦曠清名善政爲天下第一，上召見，勞勉之，謂侍臣曰：「若不殊獎，何以爲勸！」丙子，優詔擢爲莒州刺史。","content_fanyi":"平乡县令刘旷有优异的政绩，他用义理晓谕前来告状的人，来打官司的人都自行认错离去，以致监狱中长满野草，公堂庭院冷清得可以张网捕雀；后来调任临颍县令。尚书左仆射高颎举荐刘旷，称他清廉的名声和良好的政绩为天下第一。隋文帝召见他，加以慰问勉励，并对身边侍臣说：“如果不特别加以褒奖，拿什么来劝勉天下官吏呢！”丙子日，朝廷特下优诏，擢升刘旷为莒州刺史。","content_jianti_auto":"3平鄕令刘旷有异政，以义理晓谕，讼者皆引咎而去，狱中草满，庭可张罗；迁临颍令。高颎荐旷清名善政为天下第一，上召见，劳勉之，谓侍臣曰：「若不殊奖，何以为劝！」丙子，优诏擢为莒州刺史。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"。呜呼！当是时也，君臣相戕，父子相夷，兄弟相残，将相相倾...","context_before":"...利。公义则露坐狱中以听讼，讼者系狱，则宿厅事，不归寝閤；","source_end_index":296,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"72209c1d-152e-4c98-9b61-5b53e766aea3","source_start_index":260,"source_text":"旷则称说义理，晓谕讼者，而不决其是非，遂以猎无讼之虚名，迁美官而传于史册"},{"context_after":"，遂以猎无讼之虚名，迁美官而传于史册。呜呼！当是时也，君...","context_before":"...利。公义则露坐狱中以听讼，讼者系狱，则宿厅事，不归寝閤；","source_end_index":278,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"72209c1d-152e-4c98-9b61-5b53e766aea3","source_start_index":260,"source_text":"旷则称说义理，晓谕讼者，而不决其是非"}],"title":"一 辛公义刘旷诡激饰伪"}],"id":17225,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e30e-db0e-11ef-8f5a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"4辛巳晦，日有食之。","content_fanyi":"辛巳晦日，出现日食。","content_jianti_auto":"4辛巳晦，日有食之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17226,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e325-db0e-11ef-bac4-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"瓚","people_name_jianti_auto":"瓒","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e328-db0e-11ef-b7cf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周宣帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"周宣帝","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e329-db0e-11ef-a6a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"勇","people_name_jianti_auto":"勇","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e32a-db0e-11ef-8f3e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"瓚","people_name_jianti_auto":"瓒","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e32b-db0e-11ef-9b53-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"隨國公","people_name_jianti_auto":"随国公","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e32c-db0e-11ef-b542-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"瓚","people_name_jianti_auto":"瓒","start_index":89,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e32d-db0e-11ef-b038-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"瓚","people_name_jianti_auto":"瓒","start_index":95,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e32e-db0e-11ef-abc1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":87,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e32f-db0e-11ef-b9f5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":120,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e330-db0e-11ef-b579-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"隋書·瓚傳：瓚美姿儀，好書愛士，有令名於當世。周宣帝崩，帝入禁中，將總朝政，令世子勇召之，欲有計議。瓚素與帝不協，聞召不從，曰：「作隨國公，恐不能保，何乃更爲族滅事邪！」帝相周，瓚拜大宗伯。瓚見羣情未一，恐爲家禍，陰有圖帝之計。以是言之，固周之忠臣也。瓚，藏旱翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"隋书·瓒传：瓒美姿仪，好书爱士，有令名于当世。周宣帝崩，帝入禁中，将总朝政，令世子勇召之，欲有计议。瓒素与帝不协，闻召不从，曰：「作随国公，恐不能保，何乃更为族灭事邪！」帝相周，瓒拜大宗伯。瓒见群情未一，恐为家祸，阴有图帝之计。以是言之，固周之忠臣也。瓒，藏旱翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e327-db0e-11ef-bf06-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e335-db0e-11ef-909e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e336-db0e-11ef-84b9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：甲十一行本「月」下有「壬申」二字；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：甲十一行本「月」下有「壬申」二字；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e334-db0e-11ef-bfd8-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"b3e6e333-db0e-11ef-bfb6-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places